# Attach Checkpoint Parity Implementation Plan

> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (if subagents available) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** Fix `entire attach` so checkpoints it creates have full data parity with hook-created checkpoints, making them visible in the entire.io UI.

**Architecture:** All changes are scoped to `cmd/entire/cli/attach.go` and its test file. The existing strategy/checkpoint pipeline works correctly — the fix is ensuring attach provides complete input data (prompt.txt, token usage, session metrics) before calling SaveStep/CondenseSession.

**Tech Stack:** Go, existing agent interfaces (`TokenCalculator`, `TranscriptAnalyzer`), `geminicli.ExtractAllUserPrompts` for Gemini transcript parsing.

**Spec:** `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-03-12-attach-checkpoint-parity-design.md`

